							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16816#msg16816">Quote from: Self Destruction on May 03, 2005, 04:24:19 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16809#msg16809">Quote from: Shrek on May 03, 2005, 03:28:06 pm</a></div><div class="quote">The concept that because we&#039;re retired from EQ makes our opinions invalid is funny.<br /></div><br />No, what&#039;s really funny is that I didn&#039;t comment at all about how valid his opinion was or not, but you can&#039;t read. Now that&#039;s amusing, good sir! Oh, ha ha...jolly good!<br /></div><br />Sorry, I didn&#039;t get to catch all this until this morning. ~<br /><br />  Give me a fucking break. You can&#039;t be serious, by calling him a &quot;retired troll&quot; you are saying his post is invalid. No you didn&#039;t specifically say his post is invalid, but you insinuated it. Seems like its you who needs a &quot;reading comprehension class&quot;. <br /><br />Since they have already done this content then it seems to me that their opinion matters more than yours...
