						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16851#msg16851"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16851#msg16851">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2888 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 10:32:45 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">I&#039;m not bitching and moaning and I&#039;m not the one that came on here crying foul on IL now am I.  That was members from UoP.  You got called out for doing the same thing and you ask for examples you got 2 big ones.  Now you say that happened 1 and half years ago so its no big deal.  So please tell me where i&#039;m wrong and that UoP never did any of that, and that your members aren&#039;t crying foul on IL for the same things you have done, and then saying that you never did any of that?<br /></div><br />It really baffles me that people can still bash UoP for a strait that was used to farm VT a year and a half ago (like they invented it), I&#039;m not going to name guilds but it was done to UoP when they entered VT, and I&#039;m sure most guilds did it to each other at one time or another while progressing though that zone(I was taking a break at this time). <br /><br />It baffles me that UoP is still the bad guy even though we were the ones that got blocked and IL got a big thumbs up on their accomplishment when they were the ones blocking.<br /><br />Its amazing that my guild has a reputation of the cock blockers of the server when we try and apply the utmost respect in the way we play the game, and if there was some incidents 2 years ago, we have had a 80% change in members and a 50% change in officers and a new leader. yet we are still hung on a cross i don&#039;t believe we should bare when the incidents you speak of were pretty much standard practice for the zone/time.<br /><br />did IL cheat their way to a coirnav spawn? yes<br />did IL step on a few toes with little regard? yes<br />should someone post on a public forum to announce their wrong doing? yes<br />should IL be congratulated on a coirnav kill? yes<br />should tostie be bish slapped for being tostie? yes<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
