								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 133<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/ceres.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Kiss muh cute ass~<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=765"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16853#msg16853"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16853#msg16853">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2889 on:</b> May 04, 2005, 10:45:15 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hehe Hey Kilaer, how is EQ2? Bet it is less dramatic as EQ.<br /><br />I think it&#039;s a buncha horseshit how people think this is anything new in EQ. Hell even during PoP when not even 1 guild had made it to time due to bugs n shit with the flags people where STILL fighting over AoW so please don&#039;t act like fighting over old mobs/content is anything new. Time Gear is still the best damn farm gear until you get into an Anguish type guild who is still playing around in GoD zones (Qvic+) So I can totally understand why people are pissed about it, however, I am also very understanding about the lack of caring for the e-penis going on in these forums. <br /><br />I think what SoE should have done is made it a GUILD flag so if the guild gets past the content the *guild* is flaged NOT the player. That way if you leave X guild then you loose the flag and can no longer enter that zone until you either join a new guild that has the zone flag or join a guild that defeats the damn content again. Basically as long as that guild stays together all the players in it can go into those zones. I think it would make for interesting times when a guild folds. I think more players would bust their ass not to let a guild fold as easy. Then you also would not have the oh I got this shit on my own syndrom and people would see hey this guild and it&#039;s members got me what I have. 
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
