							<div class="quoteheader">Quote</div><div class="quote">First you still haven&#039;t answered the questions I asked.  I&#039;m not talking about CoHing past Hegemony in VT that normal and should have been expected since UoP knew they didn&#039;t.  That&#039;s not Cockblocking thats UoP having a 2 hour head start.  But all the other things that they have done warrants them to have that rep.  Your members threw a fit and said they never did that kinda thing and it&#039;s bs and then they ask for examples.  I gave you some and you throw a hissy about that and still claim to be innocent.  <br /></div><br />No, I&#039;m not going to answer you question! <br />1 i wasn&#039;t apart of the guild when that crap happened.<br />2 most of our current members were not apart of the guild when that happened.<br />3 we are under new leadership.<br />4 I&#039;m more concerned with events that have happened in the last week than crap that has been beet to death 2 years ago. <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/banghead2.gif" alt="banghead2" border="0" />
